# Pull requests target this fork

`origin` is **SamSamskies/the-nostr-observer**. `upstream` is NosFabrica (read/sync only).

When creating a pull request:

- Base: `SamSamskies/the-nostr-observer` `main` (or the branch the user names on **this** fork)
- Head: the current feature branch on `origin`
- Always pass `--repo SamSamskies/the-nostr-observer` to `gh pr create` / `gh pr view` / `gh pr list` so `gh` cannot prefer `upstream`
- Push with `git push -u origin HEAD` (never push feature work to `upstream` unless asked)

Do **not** open a PR against NosFabrica/the-nostr-observer unless the user explicitly asks to contribute upstream.
